{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0164_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_intro_1000_102mis", "source_sha256": "ba115c2e3b4794a9b70b209fba3c4d509970808360e2c36f21c68223acb8e394", "ja": "何か、他の言い方はないかな？　ええと……。", "zh": "有没有其他说法呢？嗯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0164_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_intro_1001_101kot", "source_sha256": "23820ab36db2ab20f57f9eb3a3e84b9caf80a9a2e7e57d3f9594d22fd87b6fd0", "ja": "そういう時は、素直に「ご鑑賞ください」で\n大丈夫だと思うわ。美咲ちゃん。", "zh": "这种时候，坦率地说“请欣赏”就可以了吧，美咲。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0164_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_intro_1002_102mis", "source_sha256": "7c05faf3ecf11030f2fc20b9c89cb5485cc989896d1586a2a354221abd605301", "ja": "あっ、音無先輩！", "zh": "啊，音无前辈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0164_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_intro_1003_101kot", "source_sha256": "de5c2a45f2fbf7d8acba8ff43459e79baf4e203a4d94013cdd43c70200484aee", "ja": "言葉遣いって難しいけど、一番大事なのは気持ちを\n伝えることだから。それを忘れなければ、大丈夫よ。", "zh": "用词措辞虽然很难，但最重要的是把心意传达给对方。只要记住这一点，就没问题的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0164_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_intro_1004_102mis", "source_sha256": "54299c4e1be7f3f63ae2bdaedc4b5573d6d918b8af1297e260762b0fe0ccfe39", "ja": "大事なのは、気持ちを伝えること……そうですよね！\nわかりました、ありがとうございます♪", "zh": "重要的是传达心意……确实是这样呢！\n我明白了，非常感谢您♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0164_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_intro_1005_president", "source_sha256": "006ee5f2c96fb4f1e9403d182b8d2b823b4cd9924956ac7a9346d50f405879d8", "ja": "ふっ……今日の試写会に向けて、\nだいぶ気合いが入っているようだね、青羽君！", "zh": "呵……看来你为了今天的试映会，已经干劲十足了啊，青羽君！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0164_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_intro_1006_p", "source_sha256": "2ebcbe9f1b295304b784de6d3e42cfa717484839449d3a60e7a4b16e86eaa30f", "ja": "何と言っても、今回は765プロのアイドル達が\n主演のドラマですからね！", "zh": "毕竟，这次可是由765名专业偶像主演的电视剧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0164_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_intro_1007_102mis", "source_sha256": "325df8aeb2b548e21349cc4d9eb136083ec37734cc7f8c34a2b28cd6ef01f4df", "ja": "社長さん！　{$P$}さんも、お疲れ\nさまです♪　はい、今日の私は、気合いが入ってます！", "zh": "社长！{$P$}先生，您也辛苦了♪ 是的，今天的我，干劲十足！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0164_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_intro_1008_101kot", "source_sha256": "8591c60955b0c61805a90543d8e1bf3691150d3a61a7191923961a5220f140a1", "ja": "麗しの乙女達が集う女学園、そこで繰り広げられる\n青春ドラマ……！　もちろん、私も大好物です！", "zh": "美少女云集的女校，在那里上演的青春剧……！当然，我也最喜欢这种了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0164_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_intro_1009_101kot", "source_sha256": "1c09927ce6e0069672abbe89f0b37fff9a7cb4320f059d57f15d99ea24400344", "ja": "憧れの先輩を「お姉さま」と呼ぶ世界……\nううっ、たまりません！", "zh": "在那将憧憬的前辈称作“姐姐大人”的世界……\n呜呜，真是让人欲罢不能！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0164_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_intro_1010_102mis", "source_sha256": "03d17c17cdd9281b02141d01af8e0ebb07630ae9baf4543f2a2e4be7806a8905", "ja": "お姉さま……なんだかステキです♪　あっ、じゃあ\n私にとっては、音無先輩がお姉さまってことかも……？", "zh": "姐姐……总觉得好棒♪　啊，那对我来说，音无前辈就是姐姐了……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0164_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_intro_1011_101kot", "source_sha256": "9aaf70c88c07f263769b29fc1e7fca2a85eba6ec754cf7699ffdc73afc39f49d", "ja": "はうっ！？　み、美咲ちゃん、ダメよ！\n言葉遣いには、もう少し気をつけたほうがいいわっ！", "zh": "哈呜！？美、美咲，不行哦！说话用词还是要稍微注意一点比较好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0164_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_intro_1012_102mis", "source_sha256": "0d3dc3c2421a727ad2bb3be17af5fac5f4713d20d93680e0c58b10e7c8dfe19d", "ja": "えっ？　は、はい！\nあの、何かおかしかったですか……？", "zh": "诶？好、好的！\n那个，是有什么不对吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0164_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_intro_1013_101kot", "source_sha256": "2462f39809674564b7ea749c26a260f45276f146df8a9208243faad1936d692d", "ja": "おかしなところはないんだけど、なんていうか、\nその言い方だと勘違いさせちゃうというか……！", "zh": "虽然没什么奇怪的地方，但该怎么说呢，用那种说法会让人产生误会……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0164_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_intro_1014_p", "source_sha256": "954bf9bba1e4bce2408a0348e0ff5dc4acbf6b1c4739c3dad277f2d8aceb66ae", "ja": "あ、そろそろ時間ですね。\n社長、音無さん、会場の方に移動しましょうか。", "zh": "啊，差不多到时间了。\n社长、音无小姐，我们去会场那边吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0164_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_intro_1015_president", "source_sha256": "010a0064c2e12707160f0abc9b176e717441944fd7f61bd7e5ea921a23dd75b4", "ja": "うむ！　アイドル諸君の晴れ姿、\nしかと目に焼き付けることにしよう！", "zh": "嗯！偶像们的盛装打扮，\n我可要好好铭记在眼中了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0164_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_intro_1016_102mis", "source_sha256": "dccc547070b749fe9a12f2e24831dbebd73209dc8695e2266a06e9a86a47cb39", "ja": "それじゃ、私も準備しなくちゃ♪\n……あの、音無先輩？　行かなくていいんですか……？", "zh": "那我也得准备了♪  \n……那个，音无前辈？您不用去吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0164_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_intro_1017_101kot", "source_sha256": "b3980a40a7b6a8da2764528bb780ca25e1a39b148376fa99d6879432bfcb0a03", "ja": "よく考えれば、私達も先輩と後輩……この関係性、\n盲点だったわ！　ああっ、でも……！？", "zh": "仔细想想，我们也是前辈与后辈……这种关系性，\n之前居然是盲点！啊啊，不过……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0164_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_intro_1018_102mis", "source_sha256": "cc415acaa5e79c17a1e3b37fc4fc42f681294466d5012d657b722ccc00b52202", "ja": "本日は新作ドラマ『聖ミリオン女学園』\n試写会にお集まり頂き、ありがとうございます。", "zh": "感谢各位今天莅临新剧《圣百万女学园》试映会。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0164_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0164_story_intro_1019_102mis", "source_sha256": "dabc9db61be94fb88adec45725f47b98c981f18643b1402e96bfa5eb1105e66d", "ja": "少女たちの、淡い青春の1ページ……\nどうぞ最後まで、ごゆっくりご鑑賞くださいませ♪", "zh": "少女们的淡淡青春中的1页……\n请大家慢慢欣赏到最后吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
